    "en": {
      "trackName": "Arcade Watch Games",
      "description": "Arcade Watch Games is a collection of 12 games for the Apple Watch and iPhone.\nEnjoy hours of endless entertainment all Ad free! \n\nList of currently available games:\n\n• FLAK ATTACK\nUse your cannon to fight off an air attack of aircraft, bombers and paratroopers.\n\n• INCOMING MISSILE\nSteer your spaceship avoiding asteroids and missiles. \n\n• ALLEY BALL\nRoll down the changing alley ways using the watch crown to manoeuvre through. Roll on!\n\n• BOAT RUN\nHigh speed action, navigating your boat using the watch crown to collect gold medals, and to avoid crashing on a treacherous and unpredictable river at increasing speeds.\n\n• DODGEM BIPLANES \nTake to the skies, with dual Biplanes by tapping them to switch flight corridors in order to dodge on coming aircraft and to pick the roundels. Thanks for flying!\n\n• FLIPPITY FLY\nFlap Flippity by tapping to negotiate the brick walls in his flight path.  \n\n• GETAWAY GRAMPS\nHelp Gramps make his cross-country getaway by swiping across to round corners, tapping to jump over obstacles and swiping down to slide under obstructions on his way to freedom.\n\n• PILE HIGH\nHow high can you go? Test your skill by tapping to pile the slabs as high as possible, exact fits gets you bonus points.\n\n• POULTRY DASH\nHow did the chicken, rooster, chick and duck cross the road? That’s up to your directional swiping skills, guiding them round obstructions and across the lanes of traffic safely to the other side. Good luck! \n\n• RAINBOW RUNNER\nRun the rainbow gauntlet by tapping to jump between the colour bands. Happy landings!\n\n• TABLE PONG\nTimeless classic with circular paddle action using the watch crown to keep the volley going.\n\n• WORMER\nOldie but a goodie, worm your way around with directional swiping to the green apple. Bon appétit!",
      "releaseNotes": "Localised to 11 languages",
